  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Place water and salt in a medium saucepan, cover, and bring to a boil over high heat."
    },
    {
      "text": "Once boiling, stir in oats and maple syrup. Cover and let simmer, on low, 3-5 minutes, or until oats reach desired consistency."
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, wash, halve and pit peaches, then medium dice."
    },
    {
      "text": "Roughly chop pecans."
    },
    {
      "text": "To serve, divide oats between bowls and top with peaches, pecans, and maple syrup. Serve with milk and enjoy!"
    }
